				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/ac1ad4b03fb28f5f88a93718c64485b4.avif?t=1791296216" width=616 height=144 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Jump in solo or team up with up to 8 players in co-op. Host your own session or join others through the in-game lobby, using built-in voice and text chat to stay connected as you take on the rush. <br> <br> <span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.poster.avif?t=1791296216" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.webm?t=1791296216" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/8738497e69a35fa3016e517952de6ca7.mp4?t=1791296216" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Run every part of a bustling fast food kitchen, from operating fryers and soda fountains to flipping burgers on the grill. Learn the ins and outs of each station to keep things running smoothly.  <br>  <br> <span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.poster.avif?t=1791296216" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.webm?t=1791296216" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/44c23ace445dc7824ca1ec739c210207.mp4?t=1791296216" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Expect the unexpected: chaotic events, strange customers, and surprise challenges demand quick thinking and solid teamwork. Communication and coordination are your tools for success. <br>    <br> <span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.poster.avif?t=1791296216" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.webm?t=1791296216" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/31b3ebae97f3411f0d4283128ea075a3.mp4?t=1791296216" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Stay sharp and manage your time wisely. Keep orders flowing and customers happy by assigning roles, juggling priorities, and working as one unstoppable crew. <br> <br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.poster.avif?t=1791296216" width=616 height=346 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.webm?t=1791296216" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804930/extras/fe228576cd2e36a6b2a0158f33f787d4.mp4?t=1791296216" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
